+// --- Signals (GEM5-024t) -------------------------------------------------
+//
+// The numbers, flags and dispositions are the Linux/asm-generic ones musl's
+// DADAO port uses (arch/dadao/bits/signal.h); the frame layout is the one that
+// header names and that musl's ucontext_t/siginfo_t define, not a new ABI.
